* B1 declared engineering support models. Not vendor-validated macro models.
.subckt 1N4148 K A
D1 A K DSIG
.model DSIG D(Is=2n N=1.8 Rs=.8 Cjo=4p Tt=4n Bv=100 Ibv=5u)
.ends
.subckt BZX55C6V8 K A params: vz=6.8
D1 A K DZ
.model DZ D(Is=1n N=1.5 Rs=20 Cjo=50p Bv={vz} Ibv=5m)
.ends
.subckt LM4040_4V096 K A N params: offset=0 tc=0 temp_c=25 rz=.25
* Finite positive slope shunt. Dropout, noise, startup dynamics are not characterized.
BREF K A I={max((v(K,A)-4.096*(1+offset+tc*(temp_c-25)))/rz,0)}
DREV A K DFOR
.model DFOR D(Is=1n N=1.5 Rs=2)
RLEAK K A 500meg
CPAR K A 200p
.ends
.subckt POT_B1 L W H params: total=10000 pos=.5
RL L W {max(total*pos,1)}
RH W H {max(total*(1-pos),1)}
.ends
